[ported by hand: the new option gets its own helper,
 sock_setbindtoifindex_locked(), with the mainline capability check, and
 the existing SO_BINDTODEVICE path is left untouched. 4.19 trees differ
 inside sock_setbindtodevice() (the relaxed CAP_NET_RAW check only reached
 4.19.x later), so touching it would make the patch tree specific. The
 per-arch socket.h copies get the mainline values.]
